mary cause."], "unresolved_questions": [], "askable_discriminators": ["History of amenorrhea or vaginal bleeding", "Pregnancy test result (ß-hCG)"], "requestable_discriminators": ["Pelvic ultrasound for intra-abdominal fluid", "Serum hCG quantitative assay"]}, "target_level": 2}
